<HTML>
<BODY BGCOLOR="#000000" TEXT="#FFFFFF" LINK="#90FFFF" VLINK="#CCCCCC">
<FONT FACE="Arial,Helvetica">

<SCRIPT LANGUAGE="JavaScript">

<!--//

   if (document.images) {

      // Load images needed [BACK] button.

      back_on  = new Image(); back_on.src  = "../../buttons/back_on.gif";  
      back_off = new Image(); back_off.src = "../../buttons/back.gif";  
   }

   function TurnOn() {

      // Displays image and updates status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_on.src;
         window.status = 'Go back to previous page';
      }
   }

   function TurnOff() {

      // Displays image and clears status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_off.src;
         window.status = '';
      }
   }

//-->

</SCRIPT>

<H3><CENTER><FONT COLOR="#ffff00"><A HREF="mailto:sascha.wetzstein@netway.at">Sascha Wetzstein</A></FONT></CENTER></H3>

        Sascha has a white 1991 Fiat Tipo 16V (sedicivalvole). It has been
        modified with H&amp;R lowered springs, Fichtel&amp;Sachs K&amp;N 57i air filter
        and a Supersprint Exhaust system. Like me he agrees that the sound
        off this combination is awesome. In the future he plans to remove
        the catalytic converter.
	<P>
	Sascha has fitted a ride-height adjustable suspension on his Fiat
	Tipo with yellow Konis
	<P>
	He has also fitted some new wheels - Revolution Modern-Line in 8J15
	ET25 with a Toyo 195/45/15 tyres
	<P>
	Finally he has fitted a new steering wheel.


